msgid "Battery capacity at which the critical battery failsafe is triggered\\. Set to 0 to disable battery remaining failsafe\\. If the battery capacity drops below this level the vehicle will perform the failsafe specified by the BATT2\\_FS\\_CRT\\_ACT parameter\\."
msgstr ""

