#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:113188
#: 3f4140026cc84dcc92713b2c9ec0c62f
msgid "This sets the mavlink channel to use for blheli pass\\-thru\\. The channel number is determined by the number of serial ports configured to use mavlink\\. So 0 is always the console\\, 1 is the next serial port using mavlink\\, 2 the next after that and so on\\."
